{"title":"Career roadmap · Data Analyst","role":"Data Analyst","summary":"A Data Analyst collects, cleans, analyses and visualises data to help organisations make better business decisions. For a BBA in Business Analytics, this is a strong direct alignment, particularly for business, finance, marketing, operations, sales and product analytics.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Business Analytics"},"about":[{"label":"Core combination","text":"Business knowledge + statistics + SQL + BI + analytical thinking"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Typical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Business Analytics","Data/Business Analytics Internship","Data Analyst Trainee / Junior Data Analyst","Data Analyst","Senior Data Analyst","Analytics Lead / Analytics Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build statistics, Excel, SQL, Power BI, Python and business-analysis skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Become a specialised Data/BI Analyst in finance, marketing, operations, product or risk"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Data Analyst, Analytics Lead, Analytics Engineer or Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into Head of Analytics, Data Strategy, Business Intelligence leadership or data-driven consulting"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Excel + statistics fundamentals"},{"text":"Business statistics, Excel"},{"text":"Analytical workbook"},{"text":"Quantitative thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Databases, SQL"},{"text":"50+ SQL q